<p>I've been working on this one for a while, and I finally worked up the nerve to post it to the mainsite after getting lots of positive feedback.</p>
<p>I know it's not going to work for everyone, and if you don't like it, I understand. This was really something of an emotional project for me; Olivia's story mirrors my own attempted suicide and mental health struggle over the last year. I have been helped so much by my partner and their loving support in my recovery, and I really wanted to write something about getting better and getting that happy ending.</p>
<p>Thank you all so much for making this site a wonderful community and great environment for me to pursue my writing. I wish you all the best.</p>
<p>-ashbury</p>
