<p>Actually, that part was alluding to <a href="/scp-2039">SCP-2039</a>. As excerpted:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>&#8230;It's all I thought about for a couple years there. It was about that time I got a visit from the gray-eyed man.</p>
<p><strong>Wilkes:</strong> Gray-eyed man?</p>
